  "changelog": "Initial release of 1688-sourcing-inquiry skill:\n\n- Enables users to submit sourcing inquiries based on product name, quantity, and requirements when no specific product is selected.\n- Transforms vague procurement intent into structured inquiries to match suppliers and get quotations from the 1688 platform.\n- Skill triggers only for explicit sourcing, inquiry, or quote requests with vague needs and no specific product or supplier chosen.\n- Strict boundaries and integration with related skills: browsing triggers 1688-product-find, order placement triggers 1688-order, supplier search triggers 1688-source-suppliers.\n- Provides clear parameter extraction and prompts users to fill missing fields (product name, quantity, requirements) before submitting an inquiry.\n- Includes robust error handling and strict prohibitions on fabricating sourcing info or misusing the skill outside its defined scope.",
